          ],
          "name": "/NCPHPG+Univers-CondensedBoldOblique",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The Hartford Chairman, President and CEO Ramani Ayer speaking at the opening of New York employees’ new "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          292.68504861111114,
          422.48959911616157,
          610.8638402777777,
          9.721956755050542
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/NCPHPG+Univers-CondensedBoldOblique",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "permanent offices in early November. Despite the destruction of their offices at 7 World Trade Center on Sept. 11, "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          292.68504861111114,
          438.0199021464647,
          623.8981053921568,
          9.721956755050542
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/NCPHPG+Univers-CondensedBoldOblique",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The Hartford’s New York employees had their businesses back in operation by Sept. 17. Employees moved into their"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          292.68504861111114,
          453.5502051767677,
          308.04134068627457,
          9.721956755050542
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/NCPHPG+Univers-CondensedBoldOblique",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "new permanent offices less than 60 days after the attack."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.44524101307195,
          493.07870896464647,
          651.5322058823529,
          10.657657512626315
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "our proven approach to asset management despite the stock market’s vagaries. It means"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.44524101307195,
          517.6682389520201,
          651.6980147058823,
          10.657644570707077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "growing our business profitably, maintaining financial discipline, controlling expenses and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.44524101307195,
          542.2577689393939,
          447.98078880718947,
          10.657644570707077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "providing extraordinary service to distributors and customers."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          346.68985334967323,
          566.8472989267677,
          601.2920988562091,
          10.657644570707077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We take the last point very seriously, as evidenced by our earning a sixth consecutive"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          591.4368159722222,
          651.5337299836602,
          10.657657512626258
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "DALBAR Annuity Service Award in 2001. DALBAR also awarded us the Intermediary Service"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          616.026345959596,
          387.6103321078432,
          10.657657512626258
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Award and the first-ever Life Insurance Service Award."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          346.68985334967323,
          640.6158759469697,
          601.2920988562091,
          10.657657512626258
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "As you’ll read throughout this report, service means very specific—and very impor-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          665.2054059343434,
          651.5609125816993,
          10.657644570707077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "tant—things to us. We strive to forge strong partnerships with our distributors and provide"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          689.7948970959596,
          651.5654178921569,
          10.657670454545439
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "them with technological tools and outstanding products to enhance their selling efforts."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          714.384401199495,
          445.4951470588235,
          10.657670454545496
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "These are some of the underpinnings to our solid 2001 results."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          346.68985334967323,
          738.9739053030303,
          601.1685126633986,
          10.657670454545439
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Despite the challenges I’ve mentioned, our revenues for 2001 rose 3 percent to $15.1"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          763.5634223484849,
          651.4161732026145,
          10.65767045454541
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "billion. Total assets under management rose 8 percent to $198 billion. Operating income rose"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          788.1529264520202,
          8.51947508169934,
          10.657670454545439
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "7"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          309.22447875816994,
          788.1529264520202,
          638.6383758169936,
          10.657670454545439
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "percent to $1.034 billion, or $4.28 per diluted share, excluding the $440 million impact of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          812.7424305555555,
          655.1769852941178,
          10.657670454545467
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Sept. 11 (after tax and net of reinsurance) and a $130 million tax benefit in our life operations. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          346.68985334967323,
          837.3319476010101,
          601.1760661764706,
          10.657670454545467
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The results attest to the resilience of our enterprise. With our strong and balanced"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          861.9214646464646,
          651.4146323529411,
          10.657670454545439
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "portfolio of businesses, we consistently demonstrate superior financial performance. Since"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          886.5109816919191,
          651.4206617647059,
          10.657667866161631
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "1995, we’ve produced 13 percent annualized operating earnings-per-share growth, excluding"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          911.1004961489899,
          651.4146323529411,
          10.657671748737371
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the effects of Sept. 11 and the tax benefit in 2001, and 13 percent annualized growth in assets"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          935.6900144886364,
          651.4266911764705,
          10.657671748737386
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "under management. Excluding the effect of Sept. 11 and the tax benefit, operating return on"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          296.4452577614379,
          960.2795328282829,
          627.239705882353,
          10.657671748737386
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/OECHKG+Univers",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "equity has met or exceeded our 13 to 15 percent target every year for the past five years. "
      }
    ],
